Name: soundFont

Synonyms: soundfont, sf2

Type: glossary

Description:
A file containing sound samples arranged in groups and mapped to <MIDI>
messages for playback as musical instrument sampler player sound patches.
Soundbank files in Soundfont (.SF2) or Downloadable Sound (DLS) formats can
be used with OpenXTalk general music libraries for <playSentence> xTalk
musical notation playback.

References: MIDI (glossary), soundbank (glossary),
playSentence (glossary)

Tags: multimedia
